e for Supramax is slightly softer at USD 12,950/day.\n\nHandysize: HS7TC avg closed the week slightly down at USD 12,201/day. Skaw-Passero trip to Boston-Galveston is up by 0.2k/day at USD 8,829/ day, Brazil to Cont. is down by 0.8k/day at USD 16,906/day, S.E. Asia trip to Spore/Japan is stable at USD 12,988/day, China/S.Korea/Japan round trip is is also stable at USD 12,413/day, while trip from U.S. Gulf to Cont. is reduced by 0.5k/day at USD 14,489/day and N.China-S.Korea- Japan trip to S.E.Asia is increased by 0.3k/day at USD 12,656/day. 38K Handy 1y T/C rate is USD 12,500/day, while 32k Handy 1y T/C is USD 10,800/day in Atlantic & USD 10,700/day in Pacific region.",
